    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E309 李静训：谁家小孩万千宠爱，生生世世好梦一场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0f9d4afe904f3873b86ab2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a0f9d4afe904f3873b86ab2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>国博正在举办特展“李静训和她的时代”。李静训，字小孩，她生于隋朝，被外婆杨丽华抚养长大，九岁去世，永远是个小孩。本期节目，我们将会讲述政治的残酷，时代的动荡，以及亲情的永恒。我们选用《萱草花》做本期的主题曲，每一句歌词好像都是杨丽华对李小孩说的话。一千四百年转瞬即逝，那些爱与温柔却温热如初，与天久长。</span></p><br><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>主播、录音：小Q，老陈&nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>节目剪辑：小Q</span></p><br><p><span>节目介绍、封面：老陈</span></p><br><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><br><p><span>萱草花（哼唱版）-张小斐</span></p><br><p><span>萱草花-张小斐</span></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211972998225595911.png"></p><br><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><br><p><span>【本期节目背景】</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">0:10</a> 在国博特展“李静训和她的时代”与李小孩重逢</span></p><br><p><span>【李静训是谁】</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">6:06</a> 李小孩复杂的家族背景：西魏八柱国，中国第一岳父独孤信，杨丽华与李小孩</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 墓志铭记录下李小孩短暂的一生</span></p><br><p><span>【李静训和她的时代】</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 李小孩出生，杨广夺嫡并登基（600-604年）</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a> 李小孩和杨丽华相继去世（608-609年）</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a> 隋炀帝三征高句丽，谣谶四起，李氏家族灭门，隋朝灭亡（611-618年）</span></p><br><p><span>【必看展品】</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2629">43:49</a> 闹蛾金钗：一眼惊艳，中亚地区摇叶金冠和中原花树、步摇结构的结合</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">47:15</a> 李小孩石棺：“开者即死”与杨丽华最后的守护</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a> 嵌宝石珍珠金项链，高足金杯，镶金白玉杯：丝路的见证，物产的交流，文明的融合</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3009">50:09</a> 玻璃：双双入选195禁止出境文物的绿玻璃瓶，西方钠钙玻璃和中国高铅玻璃</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3333">55:33</a> 陶瓷：南青北白，入选195禁止出境文物的白釉龙柄传瓶，白釉鸡首壶</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3441">57:21</a> 鎏金银壶：雕刻了希腊神话和特洛伊之战的故事</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3747">1:02:27</a> 萧皇后钿钗礼冠：萧皇后的一生比这颗礼冠更加璀璨</span></p><br><p><span>【告别李静训】</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4081">1:08:01</a> 爱与温柔陪伴着永远九岁的李静训，生生世世，好梦一场</span></p><br><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><br><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><br><p><span>李静训家族谱系图（小红书：@游游游啊游）</span></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211972974603848711.jpg"></p><br><p><br></p><br><p><span>李静训墓考古现场（微博：@老猪的碎碎念）</span></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973026449672199.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973041176891399.jpg"></p><br><p><br></p><br><p><span>“李静训和她的时代”部分展品（摄影：老陈）</span></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973097316375047.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973131675846663.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973178615445511.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973206533007879.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973241198303239.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973270956456455.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973303169620487.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973333540620807.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973365753128455.jpg"></p><br><p><img src="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio_cover/2026/05/16/3211973404406274055.jpg"></p>]]></description>
